Lolly patch 0008: no network fetch for ddsp instrument models.

Why: upstream fetches ddsp instrument models (violin, cello, ...) and their
body impulse responses from models.rondocode.com on first use. The frame
fetches nothing from the network, so an instrument that is not loaded stays
silent and the editor says which ones, in place.

Applied by scripts/vendor-rondocode.ts with git apply --directory=packages/rondo/upstream.

